  6d N=(1,1)                                       S_3 = 0
  8d N=1                                           S_4 = -1 Tr_adj
  10d N=(1,0)                                      S_5 = -1/2 Tr_adj
  remark: for k odd (H even) Tr_adj x^k = 0 for every g with invariant form; Tr_U x^k = 0 for symplectic U
